msgstr "Histogram / statistik omarbetat till objekt-API:er *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:138
msgid ""
"The histogram/statistics surface was reworked into object-based "
"``image.get_histogram()`` / ``get_statistics()`` / ``get_percentile()`` "
"returning histogram/statistics objects. The old flat histogram/statistics "
"results and the ``bin_count`` / ``l_bin_count`` / ``a_bin_count`` / "
"``b_bin_count`` methods were removed (use ``len(histogram.bins())`` etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Histogram-/statistikytan omarbetades till objektbaserade "
"``image.get_histogram()`` / ``get_statistics()`` / ``get_percentile()`` som "
"returnerar histogram-/statistikobjekt. De gamla platta "
"histogram-/statistikresultaten och metoderna ``bin_count`` / ``l_bin_count``"
" / ``a_bin_count`` / ``b_bin_count`` togs bort (använd "
"``len(histogram.bins())`` osv.)."

