msgid "For a clean port to v2.1.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "För en ren portning till v2.1.0 är det typiska arbetet:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:214
msgid ""
"Replace ``image.FREAK`` with ``image.ORB``, drop the descriptor-type "
"argument, and update ``match_descriptor()`` tuple unpacking / "
"``draw_keypoints()`` to the keypoints object (:ref:`the ORB rework "
"<v2_1_0_orb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Ersätt ``image.FREAK`` med ``image.ORB``\\ , ta bort deskriptortyp-"
"argumentet och uppdatera tupeluppackningen i ``match_descriptor()`` / "
"``draw_keypoints()`` till nyckelpunktsobjektet (\\ :ref:`ORB-omarbetningen "
"<v2_1_0_orb>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:218
msgid ""
"Rename ``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / "
"``set_exposure_ctrl()`` to the ``set_auto_*`` forms (:ref:`the auto-function"
" rename <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Döp om ``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / "
"``set_exposure_ctrl()`` till ``set_auto_*``\\ -formerna (\\ "
":ref:`omdöpningen av auto-funktioner <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:221
msgid ""
"Move histogram/statistics code to the object methods (:ref:`the "
"histogram/statistics rework <v2_1_0_histogram>`)."
msgstr ""
"Flytta histogram-/statistikkod till objektmetoderna (\\ "
":ref:`histogram-/statistikomarbetningen <v2_1_0_histogram>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:223
msgid ""
"Rename ``find_features()`` ``scale=`` to ``scale_factor=`` (:ref:`the "
"find_features rename <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`)."
msgstr ""
"Döp om ``find_features()`` ``scale=`` till ``scale_factor=`` (\\ "
":ref:`find_features-omdöpningen <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:225
msgid ""
"Use blob-object accessors and replace ``find_markers()`` with "
"``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)`` (:ref:`the find_blobs change "
"<v2_1_0_findblobs>`); replace ``img.copy_to_fb()`` with the ``copy_to_fb=`` "
"keyword (:ref:`the copy_to_fb change <v2_1_0_copytofb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Använd blob-objektens åtkomstmetoder och ersätt ``find_markers()`` med "
"``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)`` (\\ :ref:`find_blobs-ändringen "
"<v2_1_0_findblobs>`\\ ); ersätt ``img.copy_to_fb()`` med ``copy_to_fb=``\\ "
"-nyckelordet (\\ :ref:`copy_to_fb-ändringen <v2_1_0_copytofb>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:230
msgid ""
"Clamp ``compress()`` quality to 1–100 and re-check JPEG sizes on the OpenMV "
"3 (:ref:`the compress change <v2_1_0_compress>`); re-tune ``lens_corr()`` "
"zoom (:ref:`the lens_corr change <v2_1_0_lenscorr>`)."
msgstr ""
"Klipp ``compress()``\\ -kvaliteten till 1–100 och kontrollera JPEG-storlekar"
" på OpenMV 3 på nytt (\\ :ref:`compress-ändringen <v2_1_0_compress>`\\ ); "
"justera om ``lens_corr()``\\ -zoom (\\ :ref:`lens_corr-ändringen "
"<v2_1_0_lenscorr>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:234
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Alla övriga skript körs oförändrade."
